Large Anime Text Dataset
========================

Developer & maintainer: Muhammad Muqeet
Contact: muqeet@animearray.site, muqeet@anitroves.com

This product/package contains aggregated data sourced from the following
providers. Underlying source content remains subject to each provider's
terms as recorded in this repository's exports/sources.jsonl and
exports/provenance.jsonl.

  - AniList           (https://anilist.co)
  - Kitsu             (https://kitsu.io)            — public API, no redistribution grant
  - Shikimori         (https://shikimori.one)
  - Wikidata          (https://wikidata.org)        — CC0-1.0
  - Anime News
    Network           (https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/encyclopedia/)

License and use:
