    text are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
    (CC-BY-4.0).
  - Source-provided content is governed by each provider's terms; see
    docs/LICENSE_NOTES.md before redistributing source-derived fields.
  - No upstream plot synopsis, character biography or episode summary is
    included. Those third-party texts are removed from every export rather
    than paraphrased. LICENSE_AUDIT.md records this per artifact.

Attribution, per-entity provenance and license notes are embedded in:
  exports/provenance.jsonl   (per-entity source, license note, URL)
  exports/sources.jsonl      (per-source terms, retrieval date/method)

See ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md for human-readable attribution and LICENSE_AUDIT.md
